# Fyrhaven record server, self-hosted — the three values this file needs.
#
#   STORE_TOKENS       one token per workspace: `abc123=default,def456=team`
#   STORE_MASTER_KEY   `openssl rand -base64 32`  (32 bytes, base64)
#   FYRHAVEN_LICENCE   the key from your order, bound to this installation
#
# Optional, to keep records in a bucket instead of the SQLite file:
#   R2_S3_API=https://<account>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com/<bucket>
#   R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=...
#   R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=...
STORE_TOKENS=
STORE_MASTER_KEY=
FYRHAVEN_LICENCE=
